## 6. Simple mind map: Clash-style game & monetization

Here’s a text “mind map” you can use as a design scaffold:

* **Core Game**

  * 2–4 minute real-time matches
  * 1v1 ladder, optional 2v2 / events
  * 8-unit deck from larger collection
  * Simple controls + clean UI
  * Clear counter relationships between units

* **Progression & Economy**

  * Cards → levels → tower power
  * Chests / packs with time gates
  * Soft currency (gold) as upgrade bottleneck
  * Hard currency (gems) to skip time / buy boosts
  * Sharp cost spikes at mid/high levels

* **Monetization**

  * Gem packs (hard currency)
  * Season pass with exclusive track
  * Rotating shop offers / bundles
  * Cosmetics: skins, emotes, banners
  * Paid retries / entries in special events

* **Social & Competitive**

  * Clans / guilds with donations
  * Ranked ladder with leagues & badges
  * In-app spectator/replay feature
  * Event leaderboards & clan wars
  * Emotes & simple chat for emotional expression

* **Live-Ops / Retention**

  * Monthly seasons w/ new rewards
  * Weekly or bi-weekly events
  * Regular balance patches
  * Occasional big economy reworks
  * Push notifications tied to chest unlocks / events

